        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/71e660/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2018-01-04T03:42:57.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I hope this is the right place to post a story about a game I just played.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Citizen Dawn against Expat, Setback, Parse and Ra (all base). I was Parse. Everyone's set up and ready to go when Devastating Aurora shows up. No biggie, I say to the group. Parse has a Buffer Overflow in play, so I can say \"see ya!\" to the Aurora! Aurora gets discarded, Buffer blows up, Parse draws, and the next card is played.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>It's the other Devastating Aurora.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Personally, I blame Setback. I don't know what he did, but I'm sure he's responsible in some way.&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:50:45.821Z",
